on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 22] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 10] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 11] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 13] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 15] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 17] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 19] jmp [ 34]
  [ 22] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 23] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 25] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 27] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 29] add ..................................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 30] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 32] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0) + 1)
  [ 34] ret
end
